Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:05:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0312-starlte-pmsg-sweetreboot.patch (from 12377 0309:
 panic and timer -> ramoops pmsg -> TWRP, no UFS)

---
